         <ab xml:space="preserve">
         <pb n="11"/><lb n="7a2"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex47012025-04-2915-35-58" status="finalized">dang po ni <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:3831">phya</rs></note> <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:3831">kha 1</rs> na re rtog pa'i <expan>mtshan nyid</expan> don spyi 'dzin pa <expan>yin no</expan> zhes zer ba la de mi 'thad ste | de ltar na dbang <lb n="7a3"/> shes lnga nyaMs su myong pa'i rang rig gis myong bya dbang po lnga po de rang gi <expan>mtshan nyid</expan> 'dzin par yongs chod la grub pas spyi 'dzin pa rnam gcad la khegs pa'i phyir | rtog pa'i don mngon sum gyis khegs par thal | 'dod na dbang shes rtog bral du sgrub pa'i rtags <expan>thams chad</expan> tha snyad sgrub sha rtag du <expan>'gyur ro</expan> | des na rtog pa'i tha snyad du mtshon pa'i <expan>mtshan nyid</expan> ni brjod bya brjod byed 'drer rung 'dzin pa <expan>yin no</expan> ||</seg></ab>
